OL,3,GNEWSAHear ye, hear ye: Bewigged
OL,4,Abricklayers and teachers turn to
OL,5,Ahistory acting
OL,6,
OL,7,FWith his booming voice and clanging
OL,8,Fbell, you'll hear Marcellus Kearney
OL,9,Flong before you see him.
OL,11,FBut when you do spot him on the streets
OL,12,Fof Armagh, you'll be struck by the
OL,13,Fthreads ` a royal blue jacket with gold
OL,14,Fembroidery, white shirt replete with
OL,15,Fruffles and a barrister wig.
OL,17,FForget smart casual, this is town crier
OL,18,Fchic and while it may not be the ideal
OL,19,Fstyle for popping down to the shops, it
OL,20,Fdoes a great job of signalling
OL,21,FMarcellus' role in the city's Georgian
OL,22,FFestival.
OL,23,APub: 27-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
FL,420,410,260,120,0,100
